OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment gives go-ahead to major
OL,4,Asolar farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has approved what could
OL,7,Fbe one of the UK's largest solar farms.
OL,9,FGreen Hill Solar Farm would cover about
OL,10,F2,965 acres (1,200 hectares) of land
OL,11,Fsouth and west of Wellingborough and
OL,12,Fnorth of Northampton.
OL,14,FIt would also extend to include land to
OL,15,Fthe northeast of Warrington, a hamlet
OL,16,Fin Buckinghamshire.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
