OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment gives go-ahead to major
OL,4,Asolar farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FBaroness Curran, from the Department
OL,7,Ffor Energy Security and Net Zero, said
OL,8,Fon approving the development: "Solar
OL,9,Fpower is crucial to delivering energy
OL,10,Fsecurity for the country and financial
OL,11,Fsecurity for communities, families and
OL,12,Fbusinesses."
